{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12113160","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12113160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1211316001:0":{"text":"聞きました？シンドバッドさんが艦隊と交戦してるって、あのグレイヴボーンが言ってましたよね！","source_cn":"你们听见了吗，那个亡灵女人说辛巴达正在和他们的舰队周旋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56F1F395E40BE058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211316002:1":{"text":"ボニーか……あんたたちはよく知らないだろうが、あいつとは何度もやり合ったことがある。","source_cn":"波妮……你们还不了解她。我们交过很多次手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF023AC355412AC47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211316003:0":{"text":"指揮官としての能力もさることながら、相当な弓の使い手だ。うちの船は機動力が自慢だが、あいつはピンポイントで航海士や操舵手を狙ってくるんだ。","source_cn":"除了指挥作战，她用弓也很强。几次海上相逢，我们的船能靠...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88897C4B0FEBA50A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211316004:0":{"text":"少しでもこちらが体勢を崩せば、グレイヴボーンどもはすかさず鉤縄や梯子で船に乗り込み、接近戦に持ち込んでくる。そのせいでどれほどの仲間があいつにやられたか……","source_cn":"只需要片刻慌乱，那群亡灵就能搭起钩索和绳梯，然后就是刀...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31B4AC92C91C92CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211316005:0":{"text":"ここで奴を仕留めることができれば、ホジキンの右腕をもいだも同然だ！","source_cn":"如果能在这里干掉她，就能断掉霍德希金一条手臂……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C54F235606EE509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211316006:0":{"text":"お、落ち着いてください、ソニアさん！","source_cn":"冷、冷静一点呀，索尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D12795FB589C661","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1211316007:0":{"text":"まずは彼らの状況を把握するんじゃなかったんですか？このまま飛び出したら、敵にバレちゃいますよ！","source_cn":"我们来这里是为了摸清死潮舰队的底细。要是贸然出击，就完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x348205CE6EF7E2CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1211316008:1":{"text":"分かっているが……そう長くは我慢できない。仲間たちの流した血を、奴らに償わせなければ……！","source_cn":"我知道。但我不会忍耐很久……血薇帮流出过的鲜血，必须要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C637D574E020DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1211316009:0":{"text":"そうだ！今のうちにフーキンさんの魔法通信機を使ってみましょうよ！さっき聞いたことをシンドバッドさんに伝えて、用心するよう教えてあげないと。","source_cn":"对了，趁现在，要试试呼金给的魔法通讯器吗？可以把我们听...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E3962A6DE164496","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1211316010:0":{"text":"あの二人はかなり手強そうですから……","source_cn":"他和呼金不一定是刚才那两个人的对手……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CEBBFA69DB06E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","